<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5289" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμιξία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a
				being</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμικτος,</span> and so, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>purity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.16.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>want of intercourse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἅπαντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			; <i>unsociableness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				6.67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμιξίη χρημάτων</span>
			<i>want of</i> commercial <i>dealings,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.136
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμειξία.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>abstinence from sexual intercourse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				2.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
